WEBVTT

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:18.200
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:24.250
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:41.020
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:51.230
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.410
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.570 --> 00:01:01.830
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.990 --> 00:01:07.620
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:12.630
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:17.720
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:22.600
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.400
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:42.530
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:47.270
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.750
<i>continue their adventure to a new world.</i>

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:59.130
<i>The rocket launch explosion
in the real world.</i>

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:04.490
<i>Simultaneously,
a mysterious black lightning sparked,</i>

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:07.560
<i>granting Digimon violent powers.</i>

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:12.940
<i>The Chosen Ones fight their way
through a survival of the fittest world.</i>

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:21.090
<i>But a powerful enemy they met before
on Cloud Continent reappeared,</i>

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:23.620
<i>the mysterious Darkknightmon.</i>

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.370
<i>That was when...</i>

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:33.000
<i>the Holy Digimon Angemon descended again.</i>

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.890
THE CHILDREN'S FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL

00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.650
Angemon...

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:01.660
So that's the Holy Digimon.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.120
How pretty...

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.370
Let's go, Angemon!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:10.080
Okay, Takeru!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:03.300
Begone. My business is not with you.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.530
Angemon!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.760
Heaven's Knuckle!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.780
Hikari!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.250
Agumon!

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.040
You two all right?

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.920
My body hurts a bit.

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.550
Oh! Where's everyone else?

00:06:53.930 --> 00:06:55.930
I don't see them...

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:00.950
<i>Taichi!</i>

00:07:00.950 --> 00:07:03.000
<i>Taichi! Please respond!</i>

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:03.960
Sora?!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:05.690
Is everyone okay?!

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:08.110
FLYMON

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:10.670
Oh, I'm glad to hear your voice!

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:14.700
Taichi, where are you now?
Looks like everyone got separated.

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:16.550
Separated...

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:19.290
What about you? Are you alone?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.960
MONOCHROMON

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.020
<i>Hikari and Agumon are with me.</i>

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.210
I see.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:25.980
Watch over your sister.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:26.800
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:29.320
Yamato.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.230
Yeah.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:31.550
Charge!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.640
Fox Fire!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.970
Taichi-san, please be careful!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.390
There are Digimon all over the place!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.190
DECKERDRAMON

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.730
Seriously, we may get eaten!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.570
CYBERDRAMON

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.330
Thanks, Palmon.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:59.200
GOLEMON

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:04.000
Looks like we're still being chased.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:08.000
Enough already!

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:15.550
This is Joe Kido.

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:19.350
We're at a pretty cozy place!

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.830
How about everyone meets here?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.060
Oh, nice idea!

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:33.360
Wh-Who are you?

00:08:36.740 --> 00:08:38.990
NANIMON

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.830
<i>But why did everyone get separated?</i>

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.560
During that explosion,

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:50.090
I think Angemon tried to evacuate us.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.450
Takeru, how's Angemon?

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:59.930
Sleeping right now as Patamon.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:04.440
<i>I see. Angemon must've fought hard
to protect us.</i>

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.190
Yeah. I think so, too.

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:08.710
Alright.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:11.190
First, we all need to meet up.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:15.300
By the way, Koshiro,
how are things in our world?

00:09:15.300 --> 00:09:16.920
With the NASA incident,

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:21.290
all the information being exchanged
is keeping the internet busy.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.640
That becomes the black energy,

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:27.940
and I've confirmed that a mass of it
is flowing into this continent.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.310
It struck again!

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:33.070
Conspiracy theories
about this incident have appeared online,

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:35.570
so intelligence agencies are on the move.

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:40.300
Some rumor about a spy satellite
being on the rocket is spreading.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:45.020
And these kinds of theories
are creating more network traffic.

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.960
They were eaten!

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:57.880
They're still sporadic, but system errors
are occurring more frequently

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.740
in space development networks
between nations.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:05.580
These places are most likely
Zurumon's new feeding grounds.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.580
Got it.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:09.960
You guys all heard that, right?

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:14.270
<i>Stay alert and contact each other
right away if anything happens.</i>

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:18.280
I'll continue to work on
gathering information.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.390
We're counting on you, Koshiro!

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.530
Let's set out as well! To find everyone!

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:24.410
Okay!

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:25.930
Hikari too... huh?

00:10:28.390 --> 00:10:30.540
Whatcha looking at?

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.150
I don't know...

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:33.860
<i>That's right...</i>

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:38.450
<i>Since we were little,
there were times when she'd get like this.</i>

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:41.930
<i>Always looking into the distance.</i>

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:44.830
<i>Like she's waiting for something.</i>

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:49.210
Hikari, why are you here?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:53.790
I don't know, but I was called.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.510
This voice!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.060
Something's coming...

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:27.760
Hang on until I get there, Takeru!

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:29.790
Okay, Yamato.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:32.350
Me and Patamon are both strong!

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:34.170
We'll be okay!

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.150
<i>Let's see each other soon!</i>

00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:39.320
Takeru...

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:42.180
Sounds like Takeru's grown-up.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.930
Let's finish this quickly.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:48.970
Yeah!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.100
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.980
Weregarurumon!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:04.370
Patamon, I'll protect you.

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:09.160
Patamon!

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.350
Where are we?

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:14.580
I have to find my brother. Please help me!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.090
Patamon?

00:12:34.730 --> 00:12:38.040
Huh? What's wrong with me?

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:39.530
Patamon...

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:45.360
So persistent!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:49.490
Mimi, let's hurry!
We have to rejoin everyone!

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:50.790
Yeah...

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:53.580
Huh?

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:55.930
Isn't this...

00:12:55.930 --> 00:12:58.310
Hey! Look! Look at this!

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:01.050
-Huh?
-It's probably a ruby gemstone!

00:13:01.460 --> 00:13:04.470
When it's polished,
it becomes super pretty!

00:13:06.140 --> 00:13:08.050
What? Really?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.240
Maybe we'll find more!

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:12.600
What?! I want one too!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.790
Um, we need to get going soon...

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:21.110
Since our friends are waiting!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:37.370
That Digimon isn't trying
to eat us though, right?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:41.670
But we need to escape! Everyone's waiting.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.150
-Something's coming this way.
-Something big!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.440
Taichi!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:24.630
Agumon!

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:29.640
Agumon Evolution!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.890
Greymon!

00:14:39.650 --> 00:14:40.940
Thank you, Greymon.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.490
Watch out!

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.440
Greymon!

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:03.960
I'm okay...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.760
VOLCDORAMON

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:12.970
That's huge...

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:16.330
Volcdoramon...

00:15:16.330 --> 00:15:18.240
An Ultimate Digimon!

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:19.810
Be careful, Greymon!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:32.280
Those black sparks
are giving Volcdoramon power!

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.810
Let's go, Greymon!

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:41.920
Yeah!

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:56.890
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:15.160
Metalgreymon!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:26.790
Giga Storm!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:36.300
What?!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:39.870
No way!

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:41.390
Then I'll...

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:08.500
What?!

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.960
It was eaten...

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:13.110
Then there's no choice!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:15.260
You two, don't fall off!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.680
Trident Arm!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.710
This Digimon's using fire as a shield!

00:17:30.710 --> 00:17:33.280
I'll break through it!

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.520
Are you okay, Metalgreymon?!

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:53.920
Does it hurt?

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:57.300
This is... nothing!

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:03.200
Don't worry, we won't lose!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.200
Right, Metalgreymon?

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:08.770
Yeah, I'll end this now!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:50.350
Metalgreymon!

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:53.020
I can still fight!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:55.360
Okay.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.420
Let's show Volcdoramon our power!

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.660
Yeah!

00:19:24.470 --> 00:19:26.520
Metalgreymon!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:32.600
What?!

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:08.330
-Agumon!
-Agumon...

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.330
You were awesome!

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:13.210
I protected you both.

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:14.250
Yeah!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:15.690
Agumon...

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.250
Hikari?

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.170
Hikari?!

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.910
She disappeared.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:24.680
Where'd she go?

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.280
Hikari!

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.120
Hikari!

00:20:42.880 --> 00:20:44.510
Skullknightmon!

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.260
Hikari!

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:56.020
Hikari!

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.520
I'm coming, Hikari!

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.290
Hikari!

00:21:22.380 --> 00:21:25.470
Hikari!

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.510
Why?

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:32.870
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.240 --> 00:22:35.430
<i>Angemon.</i>

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:37.730
<i>This Digimon evolves from Patamon.</i>

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:37.730
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:40.100
<i>Angemon descends bearing six wings</i>

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:40.100
TYPE: ANGEL

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:43.300
SPECIAL MOVE: HEAVEN'S KNUCKLE

00:22:40.100 --> 00:22:43.310
<i>and will crush evil enemies
with holy powers!</i>

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:45.150
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.150 --> 00:22:47.010
<i>The Digimon of justice, Angemon!</i>

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:51.200
<i>Next time, I'd like to ask
about Tentomon's confusing jokes.</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:55.060
<i>Is it justice to laugh at them
or tell the truth about them?</i>

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:00.100
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:02.830
<i>The burning jungle.</i>

00:23:02.830 --> 00:23:04.750
<i>Taichi and Agumon are in danger.</i>

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:08.210
<i>Will they be able to defeat
the heavily armored enemies?!</i>

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:11.970
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Escape the Burning Jungle"</i>

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:14.870
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
